        "Exam timing for IB and IGCSE follows international calendars, not the Karnataka school year, and the two can overlap awkwardly. IB Diploma examinations fall in May for most schools, with a November session used by some. Cambridge IGCSE has a May-June series and an October-November series, and Edexcel offers a summer series and a January one. Karnataka's own SSLC and PUC examinations happen in March and April, so a student with cousins on the state track sees a very different year.",
